{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"民数记","commonName":"民数记","title":"民数记","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"15cf4962220790a4da9d22a145b019d10740b926b3bbffa17ac7fa7978ccb19d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1272},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["亚伦的杖"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你晓谕以色列人，从他们手下取杖，每支派一根；从他们所有的首领，按着支派，共取十二根。你要将各人的名字写在各人的杖上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["并要将亚伦的名字写在利未的杖上，因为各族长必有一根杖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你要把这些杖存在会幕内法柜前，就是我与你们相会之处。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["后来我所拣选的那人，他的杖必发芽。这样，我必使以色列人向你们所发的怨言止息，不再达到我耳中。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["于是摩西晓谕以色列人，他们的首领就把杖交给他，按着支派，每首领一根，共有十二根；亚伦的杖也在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["摩西就把杖存在法柜的帐幕内，在耶和华面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["第二天，摩西进法柜的帐幕去。谁知利未族亚伦的杖已经发了芽，生了花苞，开了花，结了熟杏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["摩西就把所有的杖从耶和华面前拿出来，给以色列众人看；他们看见了，各首领就把自己的杖拿去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和华吩咐摩西说：「把亚伦的杖还放在法柜前，给这些背叛之子留作记号。这样，你就使他们向我发的怨言止息，免得他们死亡。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["摩西就这样行。耶和华怎样吩咐他，他就怎样行了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["以色列人对摩西说：「我们死啦！我们灭亡啦！都灭亡啦！"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡挨近耶和华帐幕的是必死的。我们都要死亡吗？」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/NUM/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}